2Ch 7:1 , God having given testimony to Solomon's prayer by fire from heaven, and glory in the temple, the people worship him;
2Ch 7:4 , Solomon's solemn sacrifice;
2Ch 7:8 , Solomon having kept the feast of tabernacles, and the feast of dedication of the altar, dismisses the people;
2Ch 7:12 , God appearing to Solomon, gives him promises upon condition.
